{
    "version": "2.5.5",
    "description": "Windows 多网卡带宽叠加与网络加速工具，支持系统代理、多出口调度与 TUN 虚拟网卡模式 | Windows multi-NIC bandwidth aggregation and network acceleration tool with system proxy, multi-exit scheduling and TUN mode",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Hypostasis-Cat/HypoMux",
    "license": "AGPL-3.0-only",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/Hypostasis-Cat/HypoMux/releases/download/v2.5.5/HypoMux_Setup_2.5.5.exe",
            "hash": "3211615585ed52ba37a1df17264ae9eb84048623872e74a7b2669814a06b1dc2"
        }
    },
    "pre_install": [
        "# 关闭可能正在运行的旧版本进程，避免文件占用",
        "Stop-Process -Name 'hypomux', 'hypomux-engine' -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
        "# 用 7-Zip 从官方签名 NSIS 安装器中静态提取便携所需的全部文件（不运行安装器，",
        "# 因此不注册 HypoMuxCore 服务、不写任何注册表）：",
        "#   hypomux.exe + bin\\{hypomux-engine.exe, sing-box.exe, wintun.dll, libcronet.dll}",
        "Expand-7zipArchive -Path \"$dir\\HypoMux_Setup_$version.exe\" -DestinationPath $dir -Switches '-x!$PLUGINSDIR' -Removal",
        "# 清理 NSIS 解包残留（*.nsis 脚本已被 Scoop 自动排除，这里清插件目录和卸载器桩）",
        "Remove-Item \"$dir\\`$PLUGINSDIR\" -Recurse -Force -Confirm:$false -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
        "Remove-Item \"$dir\\Uninstall.exe\" -Force -Confirm:$false -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
        "# 统一主程序文件名（安装器内实际为 HypoMux.exe，NTFS 大小写不敏感，此行为兼容保险）",
        "if (!(Test-Path \"$dir\\hypomux.exe\")) { Rename-Item \"$dir\\HypoMux.exe\" 'hypomux.exe' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }",
        "# 生成便携启动器：仅对 HypoMux 自身进程注入 HYPOMUX_DATA_DIR，不写全局环境变量",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\start-portable.cmd\" -Value @('@echo off', 'set \"HYPOMUX_DATA_DIR=%~dp0data\"', 'start \"\" \"%~dp0hypomux.exe\"') -Encoding ASCII",
        "# 生成零闪现启动器（VBScript 由 wscript 运行，无黑窗），与 cmd 版等价",
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\start-portable.vbs\" -Value @(",
        "    'Set fso = CreateObject(\"Scripting.FileSystemObject\")',",
        "    'Set ws = CreateObject(\"WScript.Shell\")',",
        "    'dir = fso.GetParentFolderName(WScript.ScriptFullName)',",
        "    'ws.Environment(\"PROCESS\")(\"HYPOMUX_DATA_DIR\") = dir & \"\\data\"',",
        "    'ws.Run Chr(34) & dir & \"\\hypomux.exe\" & Chr(34), 0, False'",
        ") -Encoding ASCII"
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "start-portable.vbs",
            "HypoMux"
        ]
    ],
    "bin": [
        [
            "start-portable.cmd",
            "hypomux"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": "data",
    "pre_uninstall": "Stop-Process -Name 'hypomux', 'hypomux-engine' -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
    "notes": [
        "此为便携版：由官方 SignPath 签名的 NSIS 安装器经 7-Zip 静态提取重组而成，未经过安装器执行，",
        "不注册 Windows 服务、不写注册表卸载项。",
        "用户数据经 HYPOMUX_DATA_DIR 重定向到 data 目录（persist），随程序目录迁移。",
        "请务必通过开始菜单的 HypoMux 快捷方式启动（VBScript 零闪现包装器，无黑窗）；",
        "或 hypomux shim（命令行入口，启动瞬间有短暂黑窗属正常）；",
        "直接运行 hypomux.exe 会导致数据落入 %USERPROFILE%\\.hypomux。",
        "TUN（虚拟网卡）模式按需弹出 UAC 提权，属正常行为；不依赖 Windows 服务。",
        "需要系统已装 Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime（Win10/11 一般随 Edge 内置）。",
        "请勿启用“开机自启”与应用内更新：前者写注册表 Run 键，后者会下载 NSIS 安装器装到 Program Files。",
        "WebView2 缓存位于 %APPDATA%\\hypomux.exe，属缓存性质，可安全删除。"
    ],
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/Hypostasis-Cat/HypoMux/releases/download/v$version/HypoMux_Setup_$version.exe"
            }
        }
    }
}
